# →648 LIMIT api_calls_per_minute — Agentfile rate limiting
FROM claude-sonnet-4-6
BOOT haystack boot --bail
PROMPT "Implement →648: LIMIT api_calls_per_minute N in Agentfile parser and run.rs. Add to Agentfile struct + parser (LIMIT api_calls_per_minute 10). In run.rs, add a token bucket rate limiter: track last N call timestamps, sleep if rate exceeded. Also add HUMANFILE api_rate_limit: 10/min as a global fallback (read in run.rs alongside LIMIT). The problem: agents can hammer APIs at full speed — llmOS makes them efficient enough to cause self-DOS. cargo test after."
TOOL sh_run
TOOL ss
LIMIT context_pct 80
LIMIT budget_usd 4
WORK tags=security,governance,p0 priority>=P0
